  "result": "The gate never judged my files: both runs stopped at `SCOPE_VIOLATION` because of a file the tool system creates, not anything I edited. Nothing has been built or tested against the witnesses yet. I stopped after 2 of the 6 runs because every further run would fail the same way.\n\n**The blocker.** Each shell call, including the gate itself, writes a capture file under the worktree's `.runtime/tmp/claude-154266/…/tasks/*.output`. The gate's scope check counts that as a change outside the concept's files. I couldn't remove those files, because the gate is the only command I'm allowed to run, and an earlier command to search Core was refused. To get a real verdict, someone needs to exclude that runtime temp directory from the scope check (or move it out of the worktree) and re-run the gate.\n\n**Concept body** (`library/TrafficSpec/Concepts/motion/left_turn.lean`):\n```\nrises ( prim_heading_change(a, window) ≥ turn_min\n      ∧ prim_heading_change(a, window) < u_turn_min\n      ∧ |kin_yaw_rate a| ≤ yaw_tol )\n```\n`rises` makes it true only at the observation where the condition first holds, as the contract asks. When the window is truncated or a yaw rate is missing, the heading-change primitive and the yaw-rate atom make it unknown. Both claimed names are used. The contract left no choices open, so there are no narrowings.\n\n**Witnesses** (`library/TrafficSpecWitness/Concepts/motion/left_turn.lean`): the instance uses window 10 s, turn_min 45°, u_turn_min 150° and yaw_tol 2 °/s. The bicycle is observed once a second from 0 to 19 s.\n- **holds:** it turns left at 15 °/s from 8 to 13 s (90° in total), then stops turning, so the concept holds at 14 s. The scenario's window is that one instant.\n- **fails:** a left lane change of 10° that then straightens out. The scenario's window is 10–19 s, the stretch where the 10 s look-back is fully covered.\n- **blind:** the holds trace with `kin.yaw_rate` masked, judged at 14 s.\n\nAfter the second run I changed one condition in the witness (`8 ≤ k && k ≤ 13` to `8 ≤ k ∧ k ≤ 13`) as a precaution. The gate never saw that change.\n\n`task_result.md` in the working directory has the full report.",
